OL,3,AThe Kent village that helped shape
OL,4,AAudrey Hepburn
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong before she became one of
OL,7,FHollywood's most celebrated stars,
OL,8,FAudrey Hepburn was learning music and
OL,9,Fdance at a small village school in the
OL,10,FKent countryside.
OL,12,FThe future Breakfast at Tiffany's and
OL,13,FMy Fair Lady actress spent part of her
OL,14,Fchildhood in Elham, near Canterbury,
OL,15,Fwhere local historians say her love of
OL,16,Fperforming was encouraged during three
OL,17,Fformative years before the outbreak of
OL,18,FWorld War Two.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
